# Untitled

## Reticular exploration of uranium-based metal–organic frameworks with hexacarboxylate building units
Zhijie Chen\(^{1}\) (✉), Penghao Li\(^{1}\), Xuan Zhang\(^{1}\), Mohammad Rasel Mian\(^{1}\), Xingjie Wang\(^{1}\), Peng Li\(^{1}\), Zhichang Liu\(^{1}\), Michael O'Keeffe\(^{2}\), J. Fraser Stoddart\(^{1,3,4}\), and Omar K. Farha\(^{1,5}\) (✉)
